{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017Q9CaZ1b5cQvWqMF6uyqxW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"US-001 is complete. Summary of what was implemented:\n\n- **`migrate_suite.info.yml`** - Module declaration with `drupal:migrate` dependency, core 10.4+/11.x compatibility\n- **`migrate_suite.install`** - Schema with `migrate_suite_run_log` table (id, migration_id, status, started, finished, items_processed/created/updated/failed)\n- **`src/Service/MigrateMapQuery.php`** - Service to lookup destination IDs, list imported items, count items by status\n- **`src/Service/MigrateMessageQuery.php`** - Service to fetch messages for a migration or specific source ID\n- **`src/EventSubscriber/MigrateRunLogger.php`** - Listens to PRE_IMPORT, POST_IMPORT, PRE_ROW_SAVE, POST_ROW_SAVE and logs run data\n- **`migrate_suite.services.yml`** - All three services registered with proper dependency injection\n\nThere are still 9 stories with `passes: false` remaining (US-002 through US-010)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":337,"cache_read_input_tokens":49668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":337},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47d29d2d-8f43-4997-bf18-f179021cfe29","uuid":"088feab7-70fd-4871-aa1c-61e65724440f"}
