{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PXZzQcApsaMa2zA5YxNxSH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**US-005 is complete.** Here's what was implemented:\n\n1. **Dynamic permissions**: Added `run migration {safe_id}` and `rollback migration {safe_id}` for each migration in `MigratePermissions`\n2. **Access checks**: Added `canRunMigration()` and `canRollbackMigration()` to `MigrateAccessCheck` with admin bypass\n3. **Dashboard actions**: Run/Rollback links in the Actions column, visible only when user has the corresponding permission\n4. **Confirmation forms**: `MigrationRunConfirmForm` and `MigrationRollbackConfirmForm` with migration label and item count\n5. **Batch operations**: Import and rollback executed via Drupal batch API with progress page\n6. **Dependency checking**: Run form warns about unmet required dependencies; rollback form warns about dependent migrations with imported items\n7. **Permission fallback**: When `migrate_permissions` is not installed, falls back to `administer migrations` / `administer site configuration`\n\nThere are still stories with `passes: false` (US-006 through US-010)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":62545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":287},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d40015d6-5dc4-4d37-b8ef-a7f6409020fa","uuid":"8ad66787-cbd7-40f6-be65-980e73709bbb"}
